<p>(4) The three months ended December 31, 1996 includes loss on early extinguishment of $10 million of Senior Secured Notes, and year ended December 31, 1996 also includes redemption of Plaza notes and the write-off of unamortized deferred financing costs.</p>
<p>(5) Loss per share is based upon 24,206,756 shares and 20,081,122 weighted average shares outstanding for the three months and twelve months ended December 31, 1996, respectively, and the average number of shares of 10,133,333 for both the three months and inception to date period ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>(6) Assuming the conversion of Donald J. Trump's interest into 13,533,820 shares for the fourth quarter 1996 and 6,666,667 shares for 1995, loss per share would have been $1.29 and $0.29, respectively. For the 12 months ended December 31, 1996 and the inception to date period ended December 31, 1995, loss per share would have been $3.15 and $0.11, based on 9,025,963 and 6,666,667 shares, respectively.</p>
